                ],
                "score": 0.99,
                "text": "2.4 程序调试器gdb"
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    191,
                    139,
                    448,
                    189
                ],
                "score": 1.0,
                "text": "2.4.1 gdb简介"
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    247,
                    206,
                    1710,
                    239
                ],
                "score": 0.998,
                "text": "gdb是GNU Project Debugger的简称，也是GNU(GNU's Not Unix)开源项目中遵循GPL发行许可证的free software。掌"
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    187,
                    250,
                    1407,
                    287
                ],
                "score": 0.994,
                "text": "握gdb调试技巧，在项目上遇到问题才会得心应手。gdb 官方网站(https://sourceware.org/gdb/)"
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    193,
                    308,
                    841,
                    338
                ],
                "score": 0.998,
                "text": "一般来说，GDB主要能够提供以下四个方面的帮助："
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    186,
                    361,
                    1597,
                    396
                ],
                "score": 0.997,
                "text": "GDB can do four main kinds of things (plus other things in support of these) to help you catch bugs in the act:"
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    196,
                    415,
                    1332,
                    448
                ],
                "score": 0.988,
                "text": " Start your program, specifying anything that might affect its behavior.(指定—些参数)"
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    196,
                    469,
                    948,
                    506
                ],
                "score": 0.988,
                "text": "• Make your program stop on specified conditions. (断点)"
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    196,
                    526,
                    1262,
                    559
                ],
                "score": 0.979,
                "text": "• Examine what has happened, when your program has stopped.(分析crash现场)"
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    195,
                    580,
                    1667,
                    618
                ],
                "score": 0.99,
                "text": "• Change things in your program, so you can experiment with correcting the effects of one bug and go on to learn"
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    233,
                    632,
                    745,
                    658
                ],
                "score": 0.983,
                "text": "about another.(直接修改程序，看结果)"
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    654,
                    756,
                    1079,
                    787
                ],
                "score": 0.99,
                "text": "GDB: The GNU Project Debugger"
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    511,
                    806,
                    1223,
                    821
                ],
                "score": 0.989,
                "text": "[bugs] [maintainers] [contributing] [current git] [documentation] [download] [home] [irc] [links] [mailing lists] [news] [schedule] [song] [wiki]"
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    707,
                    835,
                    1027,
                    860
                ],
                "score": 0.994,
                "text": "GDB: The GNU Project Debugger"
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    194,
                    876,
                    301,
                    896
                ],
                "score": 0.963,
                "text": "What is GDB?"
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    195,
                    909,
                    1270,
                    928
                ],
                "score": 0.991,
                "text": "GDB, the GNU Project debugger, allows you to see what is going on inside' another program while it executes -- or what another program was doing at the moment it crashed."
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    196,
                    939,
                    869,
                    956
                ],
                "score": 0.985,
                "text": "GDB can do four main kinds of things (plus other things in support of these) to help you catch bugs in the act:"
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    214,
                    970,
                    655,
                    986
                ],
                "score": 0.991,
                "text": "• Start your program, specifying anything that might affect its behavior."
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    214,
                    987,
                    530,
                    1002
                ],
                "score": 0.994,
                "text": "• Make your program stop on specified conditions."
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    212,
                    1001,
                    613,
                    1020
                ],
                "score": 0.989,
                "text": "• Examine what has happened, when your program has stopped."
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    214,
                    1018,
                    1012,
                    1037
                ],
                "score": 0.989,
                "text": "• Change things in your program, so you can experiment with correcting the effects of one bug and go on to learn about another."
            },
            {
                "label": "ocr_text",
                "bbox": [
                    194,
                    1049,
                    1504,
                    1065
                ],
                "score": 0.997,
                "text": "Those programs might be executing on the same machine as GDB (native), on another machine (remote), or on a simulator. GDB can run on most popular UNIX and Microsoft Windows variants, as well as on macOS"
            }
        ],
